'' A whole array -- fixed or dynamic -- passed through a procedure pointer to an array
'' parameter takes a descriptor, as a direct call's does. Lowering asked the callee SYMBOL
'' whether the parameter is an array, and through a pointer that symbol is a variable, so
'' the call declined (TKO0994); the signature answers. Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/procptr-array-arg.bas -o tests/codegen/procptrarrayarg.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/procptrarrayarg.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/procptrarrayarg.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: P: 15 30
